{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;Night Drone Simulator&quot; is a game about using drones in modern wars. You will have to control various types of drones (reconnaissance drone, kamikaze drone, drop drone and others) to achieve your goals. You will have to show care and ingenuity to find targets, break through anti-aircraft installations and hit the necessary targets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Features:<br>-There are several different types of drones, each with its own characteristics and purposes for which they are used.<br>-Different types of terrain.<br>-Different types of targets and enemies: artillery, anti-aircraft guns, tanks, infantry, planes and others.<br>-Simple controls for beginners.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804030/extras/1_1200_1600.png?t=1750056076\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804030/extras/2_1920_1080.png?t=1750056076\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804030/extras/3_1920_1080.png?t=1750056076\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3804030?t=1750056076","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3804030?t=1750056076","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804030/583d13ac2b38ceee77cd7140e73e8119310f00c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750056076","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3804030/583d13ac2b38ceee77cd7140e73e8119310f00c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750056076","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"d